# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructor-provided course material.
# The assignment PDF and the lecture notes are the instructor's material and
# are not part of this project's deliverable; they are excluded from the
# repository. The team's own proposal IS kept (it is Deliverable 1).
# The path contains Vietnamese diacritics, so a wildcard is used rather than
# an exact match.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*Big_Data_Analysis_Final_Project*.pdf
*Big_Data_Analysis_Lecture_Notes*.pdf
*Big_Data_Analysis_lecture_notes*.pdf

